  { number := 191, text := "3. Companion Lean SHALL encode that refusing a tool the author cannot improve is RSI process and is not a license claim on every product. This document does not paste that encoding." },
  { number := 192, text := "" },
  { number := 193, text := "### 4.7 Formal Vibefication split" },
  { number := 194, text := "" },
  { number := 195, text := "1. Numbered markdown in this specifications repository is the contract humans read. The specification SHALL also be encoded in Lean as declarations of what must be true. Proofs SHALL live in separate Lean modules. Lean proofs are not the specification. Numbered markdown is not a substitute for those encodings. They SHALL stay separate in this repository as specified in `0008_Formal_Vibefication.md`." },
  { number := 196, text := "2. For this specification the spec encoding module is `lean/UnlicenseSpec.lean`. The proof module is `lean/UnlicenseProofs.lean`. Lake keeps those library names. The product name of this specification is PDOSS." },
  { number := 197, text := "3. Mixing spec encoding declarations and their proofs in one mash that hides the split (Clause 3.9) is nonconforming for this specifications repository." },
  { number := 198, text := "4. Companion Lean SHALL treat a mash of spec encoding and proof as `False` (see `mash_spec_and_proof`). This document does not paste that theorem." },
  { number := 199, text := "5. Every published numbered specification markdown `NNNN_descriptive_name.md` at this repository root SHALL have an adjacent Lean spec encoding `NNNN_descriptive_name.lean` at the same root (Clause 3.11). Proofs of those encodings SHALL live in `lean/Proofs_NNNN.lean`, not in `NNNN_descriptive_name.lean`." },
  { number := 200, text := "6. `lean/UnlicenseSpec.lean` remains the meaning encoding of this specification. `0009_PDOSS.lean` is the line encoding of this markdown file. Those are not the same module." },
  { number := 201, text := "" },
  { number := 202, text := "### 4.8 Back linking and exact theorems" },
  { number := 203, text := "" },
  { number := 204, text := "1. Citations of Formal Vibefication SHALL include the canonical URL https://proofofkeags.com/research/2026-05-12-formal-vibefication.html ." },
  { number := 205, text := "2. A numbered specification that names Keagan or Proof of Keags MUST also contain the host `proofofkeags.com`." },
  { number := 206, text := "3. Theorems cover exactly what they state. Dedication of this repository is not a proof that essays by Keagan McLelland (Proof of Keags) are public domain. Dedication of this repository is not a proof that the Lean 4 agent skill pack is Unlicense. Dedication of this repository is not a proof that the `btc-verified` pin is Unlicense." },
  { number := 207, text := "4. On 2026-08-25, Keagan McLelland (Proof of Keags) was asked which jurisdiction applies. He answered USA. He said back linking is ideal. This is not an Unlicense grant of those essays." },
