  { number := 226, text := "6. A numbered Vocabulary file MUST NOT exist. The form checker MUST fail if that file is present. The Unlicense numbered markdown file for specification 0009 MUST NOT exist. The form checker MUST fail if that file is present. Number 0011 is Surmount Systems Tech Tree (`0011_Surmount_Systems_Tech_Tree.md`). This document does not steal 0011 for fargo. Number 0012 is Majestic `Memex` (`0012_Majestic_Memex.md`) and is specified. The command at `~/majestic` is still a proof of concept." },
