  { number := 268, text := "4. Lean Machine is specified in `0013_Lean_Machine.md`. That document is specification 0013. Legal Lean and Holy Lean remain named components without separate numbered specifications." },
  { number := 269, text := "5. Number 0009 was briefly Vocabulary, then Unlicense, and is now Public Domain Open Source Software (PDOSS) by operator order. The word catalog lives in CATE (`0005_CATE.md`). This document does not assign 0009 to fargo or to Carbonado. A numbered Vocabulary file MUST NOT exist. The Unlicense numbered markdown file for specification 0009 MUST NOT exist. The form checker MUST fail if either of those files is present. Number 0011 is Surmount Systems Tech Tree (`0011_Surmount_Systems_Tech_Tree.md`). This document does not steal 0011 for fargo. Number 0012 is Majestic `Memex` (`0012_Majestic_Memex.md`) and is specified. The command at `~/majestic` is still a proof of concept." },
