  { number := 271, text := "### 6.2 Product claims that are not ready for use" },
  { number := 272, text := "" },
  { number := 273, text := "1. This document specifies Public Domain Open Source Software (PDOSS) and records that Unlicense remains the license. The products named here are ongoing and are not ready for use. It MUST NOT be read as claiming that those products never started or do not exist." },
  { number := 274, text := "2. Byte identity of Slake emit is a requirement on a conforming Systems Lean and Slake product as specified in `0007_CI.md`. This document does not claim that match already holds. The match is not claimed done. Slake work is ongoing and is not ready for use." },
  { number := 275, text := "3. `lean/UnlicenseSpec.lean` encodes selected claims. `lean/UnlicenseProofs.lean` proves those claims. `lean/Surmount.lean` composes stack identities including this specification as number 0009. `0009_PDOSS.lean` encodes the physical lines of this markdown file. `lean/Proofs_0009.lean` proves identities of that line encoding. Those modules are not a proof that Slake emit already matches `ELF`. They are not a proof that beastdb, SSSSS, Slake, or Continuous Integration are ready for use. They are not a proof that every file in a clone is Unlicense." },
  { number := 276, text := "" },
  { number := 277, text := "### 6.3 Named residual licenses this Unlicense does not replace" },
  { number := 278, text := "" },
  { number := 279, text := "1. The Lean 4 agent skill pack at `skills/lean4-skills` is original work under the MIT license. It is not under `ref/`. It is not a Clause 12 pin. It is not `mathlib`. This repository's Unlicense does not replace that MIT license. MIT does not meet the PDOSS test." },
  { number := 280, text := "2. The `btc-verified` pin at `ref/btc-verified` is Apache 2.0. This repository's Unlicense does not replace that Apache 2.0 license. Apache 2.0 does not meet the PDOSS test." },
  { number := 281, text := "3. Essays by Keagan McLelland (Proof of Keags) are cited by URL. They are not Clause 12 pins. They are not Unlicense grants. Local copies under `ref/philosophy/proofofkeags/` are for readers. They are not a public domain grant of those essays. `ref/philosophy/proofofkeags/SOURCE.md` records that back linking is ideal, that the jurisdiction he named is USA, and that the Unlicense of this repository does not apply the Unlicense to those essays. Full license text is still not published on https://proofofkeags.com . Do not invent that license." },
  { number := 282, text := "4. Product trees outside this repository MAY name a different license in their own residual. This document does not claim those trees are Unlicense." },
