  { number := 285, text := "" },
  { number := 286, text := "1. Lean 4, Idris 2, CompCert, and Rust are not pins of this specifications repository's `ref/`. `0002_Systems_Lean.md` places those Form 1 pins in the Systems Lean product tree. This repository MUST NOT copy those four trees into this repository's `ref/`." },
  { number := 287, text := "2. https://unlicense.org is informative prior art. It is not a Clause 12 pin. This repository does not add a Form 1 or Form 2 pin of that site. The binding dedication is `UNLICENSE.md`." },
  { number := 288, text := "3. ISO 24495-1:2023 and the US Federal Plain Language Guidelines remain informative prior art of CATE. They are not pins of this document." },
  { number := 289, text := "4. Other public domain instruments (for example CC0) are not pinned here. Companion Lean MUST NOT encode CC0 as meeting the PDOSS test. This document does not claim CC0 fails or meets PDOSS as a pinned instrument. CC0 remains residual." },
